<div class="pattern-center-blank"></div>
<div id="content" class="site-content contests-content">
  <div id="contests-app" class="contests-page" data-data-url="<%- url_for('/contests/data.json') %>">

    <header class="ct-hero">
      <div class="ct-hero-main">
        <span class="ct-kicker"><i class="fa fa-code" aria-hidden="true"></i> CONTEST CALENDAR</span>
        <h1>编程比赛</h1>
        <p>聚合 Codeforces、AtCoder、LeetCode、牛客网的近期比赛。时间统一按北京时间显示，支持平台、状态和时间范围筛选。</p>
        <div class="ct-hero-actions">
          <a class="ct-btn ct-btn-primary" href="#ct-list"><i class="fa fa-calendar" aria-hidden="true"></i> 查看赛程</a>
          <a class="ct-btn ct-btn-ghost" href="/competition/"><i class="fa fa-trophy" aria-hidden="true"></i> 综合赛事</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ct-hero-stats" aria-label="比赛统计">
        <div class="ct-stat">
          <strong id="ct-stat-upcoming">--</strong>
          <span>即将开始</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ct-stat">
          <strong id="ct-stat-running">--</strong>
          <span>进行中</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ct-stat">
          <strong id="ct-stat-week">--</strong>
          <span>7 天内</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ct-stat ct-stat-wide">
          <strong id="ct-stat-updated">--</strong>
          <span>数据更新</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="ct-platform-bar" id="ct-platforms" aria-label="平台筛选"></div>

    <div class="ct-toolbar">
      <p class="ct-result" id="ct-result">正在加载比赛…</p>
      <div class="ct-filters">
        <label class="ct-field">
          <span>状态</span>
          <select id="ct-status">
            <option value="all">全部状态</option>
            <option value="upcoming">即将开始</option>
            <option value="running">进行中</option>
            <option value="ended">已结束</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label class="ct-field">
          <span>时间</span>
          <select id="ct-range">
            <option value="all">全部时间</option>
            <option value="7">未来 7 天</option>
            <option value="30">未来 30 天</option>
            <option value="ended">最近结束</option>
          </select>
        </label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ct-list" id="ct-list" aria-live="polite"></div>

    <div class="ct-empty" id="ct-empty" hidden>
      <i class="fa fa-calendar-times-o" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      <h2>没有符合条件的比赛</h2>
      <p>换一个平台、状态或时间范围试试。</p>
    </div>

    <footer class="ct-page-foot">
      <p><i class="fa fa-clock-o" aria-hidden="true"></i> 所有时间统一显示为北京时间（Asia/Shanghai），比赛时间以各平台官网为准。</p>
      <p id="ct-sources" class="ct-sources"></p>
    </footer>
  </div>
</div>
<script id="contests-data" type="application/json"><%- JSON.stringify(site.data.contests || { items: [], sources: [] }).replace(/</g, '\\u003c') %></script>
